# The plugin SDK header set the engine .plg set is built against (headers.txt, tools.txt). Bump sdk_version when a listed
# header or tool changes what an engine compiles to or the layout it shares with the firmware (SynthVoice, SynthParams,
# SynthNote, SynthSlotScratch, EngineDef, plug_abi.h). abi and host_level must equal synth-open/plug/plug_abi.h. The module repositories vendor these files (sdk/files, tools/sdk_sync.py).
sdk_version 1.1.0
abi 1.2
host_level 1
